Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:19:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Add startup memory census and opt-in phase diagnostics

Report live, reserved, split and external GPU memory per PP/TP rank
after loading and profiling. Keep the recipe debug switches usable with
the V2 runner and native DSpark, with bounded host timing and optional
worker kernel profiling. Synchronize only for explicit timing diagnostics.

Origin: r6; dsv41reap-pp; new
Upstream: none
